					<b>We are developing LAC-MAN the effective water filter to counter drug residues in wastewater.</b>
					<hr>
					<b><u>Poster presented by:</u></b>
					<br>
					<sup>0</sup>Christopher Adelmann, <sup>0</sup>Franziska Welsch, <sup>1</sup>Sebastian Brockmann, <sup>1</sup>Carol Hanna, <sup>1</sup>Nikolai Herdrich, <sup>1</sup>Samuel Kienzle, <sup>1</sup>Fabian Klötzer, <sup>1</sup>Fiona Kühnel,
