					<br>
					<br>
					<sup>0</sup>iGEM Student Team Leader, <sup>1</sup>iGEM Student Team Member, <sup>2</sup>iGEM Team PIs
					<br>
					<br>
					Faculty sponsor: Institute of Biochemical Engineering, University of Stuttgart, Stuttgart, Germany
					<br>
					<br>
					<b><u>Poster contents by:</u></b>
					<br>
					Samuel Kienzle, Elena Stehle
					<br>
